  "lesson": {
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "meta": "交互解题 · 体积",
    "title": "在空间直角坐标系 $O$-$xyz$ 中，一个正四面体的顶点 $A,B,C,D$ 的横坐标分别为 $2,3,5,7$，则该正四面体的体积是",
    "answerLabel": "正四面体的体积",
    "answerValue": "$\\dfrac{59 \\sqrt{59}}{24}$"
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "title": "横坐标的方差与棱长",
      "content": "<p>四个横坐标 $2,3,5,7$，均值 $\\dfrac{17}{4}$，</p>$$\\sum(x_i-\\bar x)^{2}=\\dfrac{59}{4}.$$<p>正四面体顶点相对重心各向同性：$\\sum_i (\\vec v_i\\cdot\\vec e_x)^{2}=\\dfrac{a^{2}}{2}$，其中 $a$ 为棱长。因此 $a^{2}=\\dfrac{59}{2}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Axis",
        "Point_A",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D",
        "Len_AB"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 5.18,
        "y": 4.31,
        "z": 5.18
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "用棱长写体积",
      "content": "<p>正四面体体积公式 $V=\\dfrac{a^{3}\\sqrt{2}}{12}$。$a^{3}=\\left(\\dfrac{59}{2}\\right)^{3/2}=\\dfrac{59\\sqrt{59}}{2\\sqrt{2}}$，代入得</p>$$V=\\dfrac{59\\sqrt{59}}{24}.$$",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_A",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D",
        "Plane_ABC",
        "Len_AB"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 4.84,
        "y": 5.81,
        "z": 3.87
      }
    },
    {
      "title": "与外接半径核对",
      "content": "<p>正四面体外接半径 $R=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{6}}{4}a$，代入体积公式 $V=\\dfrac{8\\sqrt{3}}{27}R^{3}$ 得到同一结果。图中是棱长 $\\sqrt{59/2}$ 的正四面体，体积为 $\\dfrac{59 \\sqrt{59}}{24}$。</p>",
      "highlight": [
        "Point_A",
        "Point_B",
        "Point_C",
        "Point_D",
        "Plane_BCD"
      ],
      "cameraPos": {
        "x": 5.81,
        "y": 3.87,
        "z": 4.84
      }
    }
  ],
